                                                "sense_id": "de6ec89d-2c23-3b47-a07a-64ddc8ba5e0c",
                                                "text": "Arloing states that human and bovine tuberculosis are of the same nature and intertransmissible, and that the transmissibility of bovine tuberculosis to man is no longer questioned."
